# --- Personas Data Rules ---
# 1. Ignore all folders ending in personas/ by default
*personas/
# 2. Un-ignore your specific folder so Git is allowed to look inside it
!personas/
# 3. Ignore all the actual personal files inside that folder
personas/*
# 4. Un-ignore just the template folder so the main repo tracks it!
!personas/_template/
# 5. Un-ignore future additions to the _template folder
!personas/_template/**
screenshots
logs
designs
.vs
